#   2. facility-level 80:20 development/independent-holdout split;
#   3. five-fold facility-grouped cross-validation on the development set;
#   4. independent holdout evaluation on the original g/kWh scale;
#   5. final refit using all modern facilities;
#   6. historical 1940-1990 generator predictions with CF = 0.95;
#   7. generator- and facility-level historical emissions outputs;
#   8. a low-cost CF = 0.50 sensitivity summary; and
#   9. ready-to-copy Table S4 values and Results text.
#
# The holdout facilities are never used for tuning, early stopping, or selection.
# The inverse of log10(EF + 1) is correctly calculated as 10^z - 1.
# ==============================================================================

